:"Needles, thread, buttons, torches, bait, I have all of that. Have a look; after this town, the next market is four days off.","zh":"针线、扣子、火把、鱼饵，都有。看看吧，过了这个镇子，下一个集要走四天。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/torch","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/torch","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/light/torch","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s1.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s1.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s1.3","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"type":"item/material/cloth","id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.s2.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"id":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.graincrest-camp.folk4"}},{"id":"tithe.graincrest-c